  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DFA IRL to PATH for GNR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PATH is a global non-profit dedicated to health equity based in Seattle, US. The Global Nutrition Report (GNR) was established in 2014 following the inaugural (2013) Nutrition for Growth (N4G) Summit. PATH took over hosting the Global Nutrition Report from its predecessor, Development Initiatives (DI) in May 2023. The Global Nutrition Report has an important and unique role in driving progress to end malnutrition, through the tracking of global financial and policy commitments on nutrition.</narrative>
  </description>
